  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">手持物品提示</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 增強了切換物品時顯示在快捷欄上方的提示框，讓您一眼就能掌握更多詳細資訊。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無需開啟額外畫面即可查看附魔、耐久度、藥水效果、潛影盒內容、煙火細節、地圖 ID、物品屬性等更多資訊。無論您是在整理儲存空間、檢查裝備或瀏覽背包，所需資訊始終就在眼前。🔍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">所有設定皆可完全自訂。調整外觀、選擇要顯示的資訊、控制提示區段的順序，並量身打造符合您需求的體驗。⚙️</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">增強型手持物品提示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">切換物品時，直接在快捷欄上方顯示詳細資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豐富的物品詳情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">一目了然地查看附魔、耐久度、藥水效果、屬性、容器內容等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">容器預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速檢視潛影盒及其他支援儲存物品的內容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">實用的物品資訊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">顯示藥水、煙火、地圖、旗幟、書籍、畫作及許多其他特殊物品的細節。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📏 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智慧行優先級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">空間有限時，重要資訊會優先顯示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客製化外觀：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">設定顏色、文字格式、背景樣式、大小、位置與顯示時間。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔧 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獨立元件控制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可獨立啟用、停用、重新排列及自訂各個提示區段。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">模組友善：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支援其他模組提供的額外提示資訊。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端必須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC 與 NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組提供設定選項，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（需於 Fabric 安裝 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a>，由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a> 開發）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code> 資料夾內，檔名依設定類型分別為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>。並非每個模組都會具備所有類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchantment-insights\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantmentinsights/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/climate-rivers\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/climaterivers/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mutant-monsters\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/helditemtooltips/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
